{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/36190-world-of-darkness-mmo-has-been-cancelled-at-ccp-onyx-path-will-continue-publishing-white-wolf-books","id":36190,"title":"World of Darkness MMO [has been cancelled at CCP; Onyx Path will continue publishing White Wolf books]","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-12-23T23:28:50-08:00","id":36190,"title":"World of Darkness MMO [has been cancelled at CCP; Onyx Path will continue publishing White Wolf books]","content":"Hey all,<br /> Just wondering if anyone has heard anything new about this project yet?<br /> Last I heard it was in Test by the Devs...<br /> <br /> P.S. What Clan are you thinking of playing? I plan to buy a new high end rig just for it and I'm wanting to play either Giovanni, Tremere, Lasombra or Nosferatu and before you ask... no I don't want to paint a target on my back by being Prince. Primogen/Harpy... maybe<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:red\">ADMIN EDIT: The game has been cancelled, as you'll see further down the thread. This doesn't have an immediate impact on tabletop WoD or Exalted projects.</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/7019410/Images/Ex3%20KS%20Badge.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img31/2512/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":2,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","user":"Rose Bailey","date":". 04-14-2014, 05:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/488-blackwood","name":"Blackwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar488_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-23T18:14:05-08:00","id":35969,"title":"","content":"I want to know how long it will be before we can start testing the WoD MMO? There's been no updates so far and one of my friends claim that the whole project is now vaporware. Give me an update guys!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/891-jackalopevegas","name":"JackalopeVegas","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-23T18:29:26-08:00","id":35984,"title":"","content":"There hasn't been an announced release date. CCP continues to develop it at their Atlanta office.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-23T19:20:56-08:00","id":36011,"title":"","content":"Same I think its now in developer hell where it is forced their to nothing but wait until someone picks it up","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/893-reaperfrost8","name":"reaperfrost8","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar893_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-23T20:15:44-08:00","id":36045,"title":"","content":"I remember hearing something about it being reworked from scratch a few months back, but could just be your usual internet rumors.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-23T22:09:19-08:00","id":36129,"title":"","content":"WoD MMO - Current Status: Daikatana","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/509-tiwaztyrsfist","name":"TiwazTyrsfist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar509_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"162"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-23T22:48:57-08:00","id":36164,"title":"","content":"Given that the MMO is Eddy's day job, I'll believe him when he says it's still in active development.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-24T00:02:26-08:00","id":36206,"title":"","content":"Just done reading When will you rage 2. Something interesting is at the end of the book with short descriptions of authors. One of them (don't remember which one) is still working with WoD MMO. There's no news about game but this short note gave some hope.<br /> But. Looking for kickstarter pc things i've done my pledge for Wamachine some time ago. Privateerpress made a clever move and with other studio they're making something quite interesting. Kickstarter is a great chance for WtA (W20?) pc game. A chance that Heart of Gaia missed. I bet that many of us would pay for something like that and i bet that there's a lot of studios that could make sucha game. Question is. What would do the Onyx Path with it? Why wouldn't take a chance? What do you think?<br /> Anniversary editions have great support and personally i think that pc game would be a very nice idea.<br /> It could be like Heart of Gaia - fpp rhing. It would be something like old Icewind Dale - create a character pick some of the npc's to your pack, gifts like spells etc. There are much more ideas and examples. It's my christmas wish<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> And today's chrismtas day so I wish You all great time spend with Your familly and friends. Merry christmas everyone.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1784-werewolf43","name":"werewolf43","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1784_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"315"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-24T01:16:09-08:00","id":36230,"title":"","content":"WoDMMO is still in production. Even <a href=\"http://massively.joystiq.com/2013/12/11/layoffs-at-ccps-atlanta-office-confirmed-world-of-darkness-dev/\" target=\"_blank\">their announcement a few weeks ago</a> (regarding the downsizing of the Atlanta positions again) said that they're still dedicated to the game, even if they're AGAIN re-focusing on EVE Online and Dust 514 (I'll leave my comments about that game elsewhere.)<br /> <br /> As for a W:tA video game, or any other medium, that is up to CCP. Onyx Path Publishing only owns the rights to the tabletop RPG using the intellectual properties they've licensed from CCP.<br /> I agree that a W:tA video game would be great fun, with a fantastic story and plenty of bloody awesomeness that could be done... but I highly doubt that CCP will come out with something themselves, let alone allow another competitor to come out with a game using their property.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">- Arthur &quot;Torakhan&quot; Dreese <span style=\"color:silver\"><b>David &quot;Wall-of-Text&quot; Tealdeer</b> - US2012070036\u200b - Grand Rapids, MI</span><br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img855/1250/jv8k.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/nmeqe3m\" target=\"_blank\">V:tM 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/pavtnjj\" target=\"_blank\">Hunters Hunted II</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/l3hjgjt\" target=\"_blank\">Anarchs Unbound</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/mxyvsy9\" target=\"_blank\">W:tA 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/k5qe4j4\" target=\"_blank\">W20 Changing Breeds</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/m64m9o5\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3rd Edition</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/qxkop7m\" target=\"_blank\">M:tA 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/nd6kms2\" target=\"_blank\">W20BotW</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/780-torakhan","name":"Torakhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar780_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"576"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-24T01:46:26-08:00","id":36241,"title":"","content":"Blackwood: <a href=\"http://massively.joystiq.com/2013/12/11/layoffs-at-ccps-atlanta-office-confirmed-world-of-darkness-dev/\" target=\"_blank\">not great news lately out of the world of WoDMMO</a> with many of the Atlanta folks getting laid off in darly December ... <br /> It's still in production, but... it's getting a back seat for now while CCP shores up Dust 514 and makes sure EVE Online is getting the attention their main title needs to keep them in good favor with their 500K players.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.ccpgames.com\" target=\"_blank\">CCP's main web</a> site still shows it as an upcoming game, and the same day that they laid-off much of their workforce for the game, they had a press release about EVE Online players raising $190K and included information about WoDMMO as an upcoming game too: <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> CCP is also developing World of Darkness\u00ae, a modern gothic horror massively multiplayer online roleplaying game based on the classic tabletop roleplaying game Vampire: the Masquerade\u00ae. Founded and headquartered in Reykjavik, Iceland, in 1997, CCP is privately held, with additional offices in Atlanta, Newcastle, San Francisco, and Shanghai. For more information, visit <a href=\"https://www.ccpgames.com\" target=\"_blank\">www.ccpgames.com</a>. </div> </div> </div>From the hearsay I've read and the few updates I've seen from Chris, the game is being playtested, but it seems to mostly be rough mechanics, and some bare-bones basics still. They could probably make a PVP FPS game with vampires logging in and just using powers to kill each other in a city landscape (like a Battlefield version of V:tM), but that's not the game, nor the atmosphere they want to cultivate. There's still a LOT to do, even once mechanics are finalized, before a real GAME can be made from those pieces too.<br /> <br /> Last year's EVE Fanfest had a video that was MOSTLY rendered in-game, but wasn't exactly FROM the game itself (it had some post-production elements because it was being used as a style-guide for the artists and folks working on the game), so maybe this year's EVE Fanfest will have more to show... before another year of darkness on the World of Darkness MMO.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">- Arthur &quot;Torakhan&quot; Dreese <span style=\"color:silver\"><b>David &quot;Wall-of-Text&quot; Tealdeer</b> - US2012070036\u200b - Grand Rapids, MI</span><br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img855/1250/jv8k.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/nmeqe3m\" target=\"_blank\">V:tM 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/pavtnjj\" target=\"_blank\">Hunters Hunted II</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/l3hjgjt\" target=\"_blank\">Anarchs Unbound</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/mxyvsy9\" target=\"_blank\">W:tA 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/k5qe4j4\" target=\"_blank\">W20 Changing Breeds</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/m64m9o5\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3rd Edition</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/qxkop7m\" target=\"_blank\">M:tA 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/nd6kms2\" target=\"_blank\">W20BotW</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/780-torakhan","name":"Torakhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar780_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"576"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-24T02:10:35-08:00","id":36248,"title":"","content":"I hate to be a downer but I'm not looking forward to a new World of Darkness game due to their track record.<br /> The closest to perfection we ever got was Bloodlines and that was a bug filled mess that needed more time to polish it.<br /> <br /> Looking at what information we got for Heart of Gaia it was going to be another medioca third person action game that were common for that era.<br /> I feel to do the licence justice I would like to see an over-the-top spectacle fighter with co-op play but that would require a massive investiment of capital make it work.<br /> <br /> Finally I really feel the MMO bubble burst a while ago, now people seem to br drifting away from that model to smaller co-op experiences with the Free2Play model. I'll admit its very possible they'll bring out something that'll blow me away but I doubt it'll happen. Doublely so if they arent even focusing on the game rather than update an existing one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/982-cptmachine","name":"Cptmachine","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar982_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-24T03:51:24-08:00","id":36288,"title":"","content":"Wonder if I can Beg for a job at their SF office. I don't care if I have to run in a hamster wheel to power their computers, I've been Dying to get at that MMO.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/31/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><a href=\"http://glyphery.webs.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Ut0SZ4h.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":1332,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1332-darling_rose","user":"Darling_Rose","date":".  Wasn't Finished! 12-24-2013, 06:52 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1332-darling_rose","name":"Darling_Rose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1332_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-24T07:10:41-08:00","id":36357,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Torakhan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/36190-world-of-darkness-mmo-has-been-cancelled-at-ccp-onyx-path-will-continue-publishing-white-wolf-books?p=36241#post36241\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Blackwood: <a href=\"http://massively.joystiq.com/2013/12/11/layoffs-at-ccps-atlanta-office-confirmed-world-of-darkness-dev/\" target=\"_blank\">not great news lately out of the world of WoDMMO</a> with many of the Atlanta folks getting laid off in darly December ... It's still in production, but... it's getting a back seat for now while CCP shores up Dust 514 and makes sure EVE Online is getting the attention their main title needs to keep them in good favor with their 500K players. <a href=\"http://www.ccpgames.com\" target=\"_blank\">CCP's main web</a> site still shows it as an upcoming game, and the same day that they laid-off much of their workforce for the game, they had a press release about EVE Online players raising $190K and included information about WoDMMO as an upcoming game too: From the hearsay I've read and the few updates I've seen from Chris, the game is being playtested, but it seems to mostly be rough mechanics, and some bare-bones basics still. They could probably make a PVP FPS game with vampires logging in and just using powers to kill each other in a city landscape (like a Battlefield version of V:tM), but that's not the game, nor the atmosphere they want to cultivate. There's still a LOT to do, even once mechanics are finalized, before a real GAME can be made from those pieces too. Last year's EVE Fanfest had a video that was MOSTLY rendered in-game, but wasn't exactly FROM the game itself (it had some post-production elements because it was being used as a style-guide for the artists and folks working on the game), so maybe this year's EVE Fanfest will have more to show... before another year of darkness on the World of Darkness MMO.</div> </div> </div> </div> Thanks mate... so we are still a few years out. Le sigh","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/7019410/Images/Ex3%20KS%20Badge.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img31/2512/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/488-blackwood","name":"Blackwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar488_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-24T07:31:11-08:00","id":36366,"title":"","content":"I'm with you Cptmachine.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Onyx Path Kickstarters I back.<br /> W20, MtC, CB20, DtD, MtAs20, BotW20, Wraith 20th.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1442-paladindemo","name":"PaladinDemo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"622"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-24T07:50:56-08:00","id":36373,"title":"","content":"I think the WoD MMO have been abandoned. Its just there to say, &quot;Look, we're doing something other than Eve.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Onyx Path Kickstarters I back.<br /> W20, MtC, CB20, DtD, MtAs20, BotW20, Wraith 20th.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1442-paladindemo","name":"PaladinDemo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"622"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-24T11:26:27-08:00","id":36473,"title":"","content":"Yeah, I'm thinking the same.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/7019410/Images/Ex3%20KS%20Badge.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img31/2512/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/488-blackwood","name":"Blackwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar488_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-24T12:23:56-08:00","id":36501,"title":"","content":"Just an FYI that Onyx Path Publishing is not involved with the MMO, so asking here isn't going to get much information since the OPP crew isn't part of CCP (the company making the MMO).<br /> <br /> -MMM","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Owner/Editor - FlamesRising.com","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/949-matt-m-mcelroy","name":"Matt-M-McElroy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar949_2.jpeg","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-24T20:41:22-08:00","id":36722,"title":"","content":"It's hard to say that the game has been abandoned when they still have paid staff working on it... just fewer.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">- Arthur &quot;Torakhan&quot; Dreese <span style=\"color:silver\"><b>David &quot;Wall-of-Text&quot; Tealdeer</b> - US2012070036\u200b - Grand Rapids, MI</span><br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img855/1250/jv8k.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/nmeqe3m\" target=\"_blank\">V:tM 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/pavtnjj\" target=\"_blank\">Hunters Hunted II</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/l3hjgjt\" target=\"_blank\">Anarchs Unbound</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/mxyvsy9\" target=\"_blank\">W:tA 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/k5qe4j4\" target=\"_blank\">W20 Changing Breeds</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/m64m9o5\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3rd Edition</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/qxkop7m\" target=\"_blank\">M:tA 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/nd6kms2\" target=\"_blank\">W20BotW</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/780-torakhan","name":"Torakhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar780_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"576"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-25T03:09:18-08:00","id":36851,"title":"","content":"As I mentioned in the other MMO thread, Eddy's day job is at CCP, working on the WoD MMO. He says he's still working on it, and I'm inclined to believe him.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-25T04:15:41-08:00","id":36857,"title":"","content":"CCP has a long and proud standing tradition of keeping projects going forever on a skeleton crew until either their vision becomes clear, technology progresses or interest is renewed by the public.<br /> <br /> EvE's &quot;ambulation&quot; or &quot;WiS&quot;-project for EvE being the prime example. CCP kept that project going in varying capacity for almost 6 years before making it a reality in their MMO.<br /> <br /> Now; I hope it won't take 6 years for WoD MMO but I wouldn't be too surprised if we wont hear anything really new for a year or more.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1700-blue-fox","name":"Blue Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1700_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-25T04:56:17-08:00","id":36867,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/36190-world-of-darkness-mmo-has-been-cancelled-at-ccp-onyx-path-will-continue-publishing-white-wolf-books?p=36045#post36045\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I remember hearing something about it being reworked from scratch a few months back, but could just be your usual internet rumors.</div> </div> </div> </div>There is no shortage of internet rumors spouted as fact about this game (and many others I suppose). However, asking Onyx Path folks, who are creating tabletop games, and not part of CCP for specifics isn't likely to reveal much new information.<br /> <br /> -MMM","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Owner/Editor - FlamesRising.com","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/949-matt-m-mcelroy","name":"Matt-M-McElroy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar949_2.jpeg","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-25T16:59:48-08:00","id":37067,"title":"","content":"Whether it's vaporware is a matter of opinion at the moment, but <a href=\"http://massively.joystiq.com/2013/12/11/layoffs-at-ccps-atlanta-office-confirmed-world-of-darkness-dev/\" target=\"_blank\">a bunch of people were taken off of it recently.</a> Development continues with the people they have left.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/233-daydreamer","name":"Daydreamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar233_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"193"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-25T17:46:31-08:00","id":37083,"title":"","content":"It probably has more to do with DUST541's colossal failure and eve's declining revenue streams, then again it isn't the first time a poorly released game crashede a game company's development projects.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1072-theye1","name":"theye1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1072_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-25T18:10:36-08:00","id":37091,"title":"","content":"The reason why I have it in OP's forum is that WW doesn't have an active forum anymore. Though thanks for the update. Developers, keep the fans updated from time to time so that we won't have a Half-Life 3 feeling when we talk about the MMO.<br /> <br /> Again thanks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/891-jackalopevegas","name":"JackalopeVegas","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-25T19:11:24-08:00","id":37098,"title":"","content":"It seems like I keep having to respond to this because someone starts a new thread about this every other day...<br /> <br /> CCP doesn't want to talk about, or update the public about the game that is in production because it has been so far away from being released that they KNOW that they can't sustain the interest.<br /> The issue is that they're creating a game that already has a fanatic player base, and has done so in an era where people can't wait and expect updates and immediate gratification. It was probably foolish of them to expect that they could make the announcement and expect that fans would go &quot;Oh, that's cool... thanks. We'll now wait patiently for our game to come out in due time.&quot;<br /> <br /> It's cool that they've released some information, but, to be honest, they're a business and they're dealing with some other properties that are their bread and butter with folks already paying them money, and they're focusing on those. WoDMMO isn't their priority, but WoDMMO has never been without people working on the project, even in the leanest of times either.<br /> <br /> We may get some more &quot;updates&quot; at this year's EVE Fanfest, but until they can shore up EVE Online and its tie-in game Dust 514, they probably won't put WoDMMO back into full-steam production again, which means its release is likely pushed back even farther than they had expected just earlier this year (note: they've never given us a real release date either.)<br /> <br /> What hurts its reputation and interest are the people who keep saying &quot;This game is never coming out! It's been canceled! It's vaporware!&quot; These trolls are just hurting the game they supposedly love, and griping about it will never help it be produced any faster.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">- Arthur &quot;Torakhan&quot; Dreese <span style=\"color:silver\"><b>David &quot;Wall-of-Text&quot; Tealdeer</b> - US2012070036\u200b - Grand Rapids, MI</span><br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img855/1250/jv8k.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/nmeqe3m\" target=\"_blank\">V:tM 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/pavtnjj\" target=\"_blank\">Hunters Hunted II</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/l3hjgjt\" target=\"_blank\">Anarchs Unbound</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/mxyvsy9\" target=\"_blank\">W:tA 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/k5qe4j4\" target=\"_blank\">W20 Changing Breeds</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/m64m9o5\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3rd Edition</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/qxkop7m\" target=\"_blank\">M:tA 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/nd6kms2\" target=\"_blank\">W20BotW</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/780-torakhan","name":"Torakhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar780_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"576"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-26T00:00:23-08:00","id":37204,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TiwazTyrsfist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/36190-world-of-darkness-mmo-has-been-cancelled-at-ccp-onyx-path-will-continue-publishing-white-wolf-books?p=36129#post36129\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">WoD MMO - Current Status: Daikatana</div> </div> </div> </div>Nah. Duke Nukem Forever.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1268-cosmic-mind","name":"Cosmic Mind","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1268_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-26T03:41:03-08:00","id":37262,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Torakhan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/36190-world-of-darkness-mmo-has-been-cancelled-at-ccp-onyx-path-will-continue-publishing-white-wolf-books?p=37098#post37098\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It seems like I keep having to respond to this because someone starts a new thread about this every other day...<br /> <br /> CCP doesn't want to talk about, or update the public about the game that is in production because it has been so far away from being released that they KNOW that they can't sustain the interest.<br /> The issue is that they're creating a game that already has a fanatic player base, and has done so in an era where people can't wait and expect updates and immediate gratification. It was probably foolish of them to expect that they could make the announcement and expect that fans would go &quot;Oh, that's cool... thanks. We'll now wait patiently for our game to come out in due time.&quot;<br /> <br /> It's cool that they've released some information, but, to be honest, they're a business and they're dealing with some other properties that are their bread and butter with folks already paying them money, and they're focusing on those. WoDMMO isn't their priority, but WoDMMO has never been without people working on the project, even in the leanest of times either.<br /> <br /> We may get some more &quot;updates&quot; at this year's EVE Fanfest, but until they can shore up EVE Online and its tie-in game Dust 514, they probably won't put WoDMMO back into full-steam production again, which means its release is likely pushed back even farther than they had expected just earlier this year (note: they've never given us a real release date either.)<br /> <br /> What hurts its reputation and interest are the people who keep saying &quot;This game is never coming out! It's been canceled! It's vaporware!&quot; These trolls are just hurting the game they supposedly love, and griping about it will never help it be produced any faster.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think it will end up being vaporware. I hope I'm wrong.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1800-randaconda","name":"Randaconda","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1800_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"22"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-26T06:51:22-08:00","id":37307,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Torakhan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/36190-world-of-darkness-mmo-has-been-cancelled-at-ccp-onyx-path-will-continue-publishing-white-wolf-books?p=37098#post37098\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What hurts its reputation and interest are the people who keep saying &quot;This game is never coming out! It's been canceled! It's vaporware!&quot; These trolls are just hurting the game they supposedly love, and griping about it will never help it be produced any faster.</div> </div> </div> </div>this is a very strange thing to say. doubt that a game will be released from won't impact sales of a game when it actually is released several years later. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/275-leaper","name":"Leaper","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar275_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-26T14:15:48-08:00","id":37503,"title":"","content":"Agreed. Once the game is on schedule to be released, the advertising campaign will swing into full effect. If any of these doubts are even remembered, they will have been buried by the long years, and then blasted away by the news the game is on its way.<br /> <br /> As Ian said, Eddy continues to work on the game, so it can't be dead yet.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>I game. This is the way.</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8-storyteller","name":"Storyteller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-26T16:12:26-08:00","id":37544,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Storyteller</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/36190-world-of-darkness-mmo-has-been-cancelled-at-ccp-onyx-path-will-continue-publishing-white-wolf-books?p=37503#post37503\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Agreed. Once the game is on schedule to be released, the advertising campaign will swing into full effect. If any of these doubts are even remembered, they will have been buried by the long years, and then blasted away by the news the game is on its way.<br /> <br /> As Ian said, Eddy continues to work on the game, so it can't be dead yet.</div> </div> </div> </div>And you don't pay 50 software and art people in Atlanta to sit around and do nothing. You're talking about a minimum burn rate of 3 million a year, more realistically between 4 and 5 million per year. If CCP didn't believe it would result in payoff they wouldn't be sinking that kind of cash into it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-27T02:13:01-08:00","id":37769,"title":"","content":"Thanks for the responses Matt, Ian and Torakhan. It's given me some hope. I'll shoot Eddy a message or something. See what he can say to enlighten us lonely mortals. Personally if/when it comes out Ian/Matt... you two better be playing. How else will I be able to form a Coterie with you both and take over New Orleans/L.A.?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/7019410/Images/Ex3%20KS%20Badge.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img31/2512/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/488-blackwood","name":"Blackwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar488_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-27T18:45:28-08:00","id":38105,"title":"","content":"As long as people realize that Austin is MY turf...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Bipolar vampire...can't decide to feast for fun or for rage...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/101-jadedtruebrujah","name":"JadedTrueBrujah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-27T19:22:10-08:00","id":38121,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Blue Fox</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/36190-world-of-darkness-mmo-has-been-cancelled-at-ccp-onyx-path-will-continue-publishing-white-wolf-books?p=36857#post36857\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">CCP has a long and proud standing tradition of keeping projects going forever on a skeleton crew until either their vision becomes clear, technology progresses or interest is renewed by the public.<br /> <br /> EvE's &quot;ambulation&quot; or &quot;WiS&quot;-project for EvE being the prime example. CCP kept that project going in varying capacity for almost 6 years before making it a reality in their MMO.<br /> <br /> Now; I hope it won't take 6 years for WoD MMO but I wouldn't be too surprised if we wont hear anything really new for a year or more.</div> </div> </div> </div>I wouldn't really call a staff of 50 a skeleton crew.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-28T02:36:33-08:00","id":38210,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Odd_Canuck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/36190-world-of-darkness-mmo-has-been-cancelled-at-ccp-onyx-path-will-continue-publishing-white-wolf-books?p=38121#post38121\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wouldn't really call a staff of 50 a skeleton crew.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's because THIS project isn't on a skeleton crew but Walking-in-station was. It had only 2 coders working on it for several years after the initial project was shoved aside to wait for better times.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1700-blue-fox","name":"Blue Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1700_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-30T07:57:28-08:00","id":39387,"title":"","content":"I'd be happy to see something come of it, but I honestly don't think the MMO will ever see the light of day. Every time CCP has layoffs, they seem to come out of White Wolf and/or the WOD MMO team, and they're constantly refocusing on Dust 514 and EVE. They just don't seem all that interested in actually making the WOD game.<br /> *sigh*<br /> Oh well. As long as they keep cashing the license checks from Onyx Path, I'll be happy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/nbylxup\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/n18segp\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0v25ewp\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/n77xu8p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1667-novagain","name":"Novagain","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"92"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-30T08:31:34-08:00","id":39404,"title":"","content":"They only want to focus on Eve and Dust, we're not going to get anything. They even had the trailer and tech demo on the brief VtM documentary on the Kindred the Embraced Book of Nod edition, the exact same trailer and tech demo from way back when, and still trying to convince us that they have made big strides towards completing it. I suspect that CCP is going to keep showing the same trailer and tech demo trying to convince us that their doing something when their not.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Onyx Path Kickstarters I back.<br /> W20, MtC, CB20, DtD, MtAs20, BotW20, Wraith 20th.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1442-paladindemo","name":"PaladinDemo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"622"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-30T17:17:25-08:00","id":39704,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PaladinDemo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/36190-world-of-darkness-mmo-has-been-cancelled-at-ccp-onyx-path-will-continue-publishing-white-wolf-books?p=39404#post39404\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They only want to focus on Eve and Dust, we're not going to get anything. They even had the trailer and tech demo on the brief VtM documentary on the Kindred the Embraced Book of Nod edition, the exact same trailer and tech demo from way back when, and still trying to convince us that they have made big strides towards completing it. I suspect that CCP is going to keep showing the same trailer and tech demo trying to convince us that their doing something when their not.</div> </div> </div> </div>That is because EVE Online is making them money, and Dust 514 is connected to EVE. They need their cash cows to be healthy so that they can even pay the bills to keep from shuttering WoDMMO. If EVE Online was showing weakness, and Dust 514 could use the help, then they needed to shore up those games. <br /> <br /> As for their Public Relations campaign for WoDMMO... there really isn't one, and at this early of development there shouldn't be one either. They released a few bits and pieces of very early development to fantatics of the IP to make them feel good, and (as is the way of the Internet) it has caused people to somehow assume that they are entitled to more information, that WoDMMO is their primary concern, and created a massive amount of trolling due to what is unfortunate, but business-related decisions. <br /> <br /> We are hyper-sensitive to the actions, or perceived inactions of CCP, but until Eddy puts up a post that he's looking for a new job, and the other 40 or so people working on WoDMMO are transferred away, or are fired, we SHOULD assume that the game is still in development.<br /> <br /> CCP probably should not have announced the game's development, or shown work for the game, or done anything that has lead to anyone knowing/caring about the game, or expecting anything from it until they have officially begun their PR Campaign for the game... But I don't feel let-down because they haven't promised me anything, and the game has continued to be in production, even through the darkest of days of all of this. It may not be in development at a speed that I would like, but if EVE Online suffers and CCP can't afford WoDMMO, then it WILL be canceled, so a strong EVE Online and Dust 514 only benefits WoDMMO.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">- Arthur &quot;Torakhan&quot; Dreese <span style=\"color:silver\"><b>David &quot;Wall-of-Text&quot; Tealdeer</b> - US2012070036\u200b - Grand Rapids, MI</span><br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img855/1250/jv8k.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/nmeqe3m\" target=\"_blank\">V:tM 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/pavtnjj\" target=\"_blank\">Hunters Hunted II</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/l3hjgjt\" target=\"_blank\">Anarchs Unbound</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/mxyvsy9\" target=\"_blank\">W:tA 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/k5qe4j4\" target=\"_blank\">W20 Changing Breeds</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/m64m9o5\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3rd Edition</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/qxkop7m\" target=\"_blank\">M:tA 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/nd6kms2\" target=\"_blank\">W20BotW</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/780-torakhan","name":"Torakhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar780_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"576"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-30T19:30:53-08:00","id":39741,"title":"","content":"It's kind of difficult for them not to have announced the MMO, as it was a stated goal of the merger. Other than that I agree with everything else you said.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Onyx Path Forum Administrator</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">Posts in this color are moderator posts</span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this color mean a Great Old One has driven me mad.</span></span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11-darksider","name":"Darksider","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11_2.jpeg","title":"Forum Administrator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1692"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-31T20:11:14-08:00","id":40315,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Torakhan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/36190-world-of-darkness-mmo-has-been-cancelled-at-ccp-onyx-path-will-continue-publishing-white-wolf-books?p=39704#post39704\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As for their Public Relations campaign for WoDMMO... there really isn't one, and <b>at this early of development</b> there shouldn't be one either.</div> </div> </div> </div>I agree with a lot of what you're saying. They definitely shouldn't have talked until they had something to show. But the bolded part... eh. It's been in development <b>since 2006</b>. It's a little late to call &quot;early&quot; development. It's not Duke Nukem Forever yet... but it IS about 2/3rds there. In another year, we'll be able to start a &quot;things that took less time than the WoD MMO&quot; list, and just copy most of <a href=\"http://duke.a-13.net/\" target=\"_blank\">this</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please add signature.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/615-the-hanged-man","name":"The Hanged Man","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-01T09:12:45-08:00","id":40524,"title":"","content":"There's a question I want to ask, but I'm scared to ask.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Onyx Path Kickstarters I back.<br /> W20, MtC, CB20, DtD, MtAs20, BotW20, Wraith 20th.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1442-paladindemo","name":"PaladinDemo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"622"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-01T15:00:46-08:00","id":40748,"title":"","content":"I wonder if CCP or Onyx Path would mind, in the meantime, if someone made a WoD non-MMO fangame using something like <a href=\"http://www.rpgmakerweb.com\" target=\"_blank\">RPGMaker</a>. There have been several interesting horror games like <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=A37gAc_WHoQ\" target=\"_blank\"><i>Skinwalker</i></a>, <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dVPopZqFzkc\" target=\"_blank\"><i>Ib</i></a> and <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6iLVoiATJg4\" target=\"_blank\"><i>Paranoiac</i></a>, for example, and I'd love to see someone try and experiment with the program for something like WoD. As a fan-game, it wouldn't be for profit, but for fun and as a work of fan-art; surely it could also bring publicity to the WoD fandom and maybe help with the &quot;WoD is dead&quot; thing going around. Loads of LPs on YouTube exist of free, indie-type games, some played by very prominent figures on the site.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-01T15:35:55-08:00","id":40762,"title":"","content":"WoD as a MMO is dead or CCP isn't making any effort in general. WoD games outside of CCP are still alive, on occasion I play Hunter the Reckoning (Redeemer mostly, stuck on the first and Wayward). I still know people who still play VtM Bloodlines. But it still is reasonable that CCP would rather keep their efforts focused on Eve and Dust. They know the Eve universe the best, so more people are gonna be on Eve rather than WoD. If CCP did the same thing as EA has been doing (you make the game your way, we'll help with marketing), we would have heard about a open beta, demo, or even a release date.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Onyx Path Kickstarters I back.<br /> W20, MtC, CB20, DtD, MtAs20, BotW20, Wraith 20th.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1442-paladindemo","name":"PaladinDemo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"622"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-01T16:06:37-08:00","id":40782,"title":"","content":"Many companies have taken down fan-made video game projects once they got wind of them (<i>Yes, even ones that were in no way trying to make a profit</i>). Probably the most well-known take down was Square over a Chrono Trigger fan project.<br /> Then there are companies that do not mind at all. Whatever the case: <b>ASK</b> the company first and see what their official stance is.<br /> <br /> Werewolf: the Apocalypse seems to be cursed when it comes to video games. Because many people forget that Capcom had a W:tA game in the works for Sega Saturn and PS1 at the time. There is a prototype that exists of a very unfinished game that looked like it would play similar to Shadowrun for the NES: You can find a Youtube video of it online.<br /> Then I remember that Heart of Gaia's other big issue was that it made it that no other type of W:tA game could be made after it due handing the video game rights over.<br /> So the only way a W:tA video game could be made is if those rights have fallen back to CCP/White Wolf.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Rage CCG Collector and Artist. Visit the <a href=\"http://rageccg.proboards.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Rage CCG Forums</a>.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img818/5825/w20supportercliath125.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img839/9002/ylxu.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1137-laughing-hyena","name":"Laughing Hyena","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-01T16:10:29-08:00","id":40788,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Laughing Hyena</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/36190-world-of-darkness-mmo-has-been-cancelled-at-ccp-onyx-path-will-continue-publishing-white-wolf-books?p=40782#post40782\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Many companies have taken down fan-made video game projects once they got wind of them (<i>Yes, even ones that were in no way trying to make a profit</i>). Probably the most well-known take down was Square over a Chrono Trigger fan project.<br /> Then there are companies that do not mind at all. Whatever the case: <b>ASK</b> the company first and see what their official stance is.</div> </div> </div> </div>Good point. I didn't realize that the problem with and the idea of a fan-made video game was so widespread.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Laughing Hyena</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/36190-world-of-darkness-mmo-has-been-cancelled-at-ccp-onyx-path-will-continue-publishing-white-wolf-books?p=40782#post40782\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Then I remember that Heart of Gaia's other big issue was that it made it that no other type of W:tA game could be made after it due handing the video game rights over.</div> </div> </div> </div>I thought I saw something like this said before, but I only remember now that you bring it up. Who owned the rights at the time, out of curiosity?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments"