sometime? I mean it would be a pretty bad business strategy to buy WW pure and only for getting the rights on the WOD franchise and then not make the bloody game. Why would they show trailers to the EVE fanfest audience if the game never gets made? That would be embarrassing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1873-jan-paparazzi","name":"Jan Paparazzi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1873_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"257"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-04T16:28:55-08:00","id":42543,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jan Paparazzi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/36190-world-of-darkness-mmo-has-been-cancelled-at-ccp-onyx-path-will-continue-publishing-white-wolf-books?p=42534#post42534\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Why would they show trailers to the EVE fanfest audience if the game never gets made? That would be embarrassing.</div> </div> </div> </div> Ever heard of StarCraft Ghost?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For these reasons, the trade of a soldier is held the most honourable of all others; because a soldier is a Yahoo hired to kill, in cold blood, as many of his own species, who have never offended him, as possibly he can.&quot; \u2015 from &quot;Gulliver's Travels&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1041-brjedi26","name":"brjedi26","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1041_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"495"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-04T17:36:29-08:00","id":42594,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jan Paparazzi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/36190-world-of-darkness-mmo-has-been-cancelled-at-ccp-onyx-path-will-continue-publishing-white-wolf-books?p=42534#post42534\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Isn't it logical they will make a WOD MMO sometime? I mean it would be a pretty bad business strategy to buy WW pure and only for getting the rights on the WOD franchise and then not make the bloody game. Why would they show trailers to the EVE fanfest audience if the game never gets made? That would be embarrassing.</div> </div> </div> </div>It is logical that they should do everything within good business-sense to make the game, yes. However, the best laid plans and all that. Sometimes what looked like the perfect idea up front doesn't pan out in the end. There always comes a point when a company struggling with a project has to decide, &quot;Is it a good idea to keep pursuing this? Or should we just cut our losses?&quot;<br /> <br /> That hasn't happened yet with the WOD MMO as far as I know. Some of the folks we know continue to work on the project. All we as fans can do is keep hoping, and make sure CCP knows we still want the game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>I game. This is the way.</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8-storyteller","name":"Storyteller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-05T09:16:42-08:00","id":42923,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>brjedi26</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/36190-world-of-darkness-mmo-has-been-cancelled-at-ccp-onyx-path-will-continue-publishing-white-wolf-books?p=42543#post42543\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Ever heard of StarCraft Ghost?</div> </div> </div> </div>Hah, completely forgot about that one. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1873-jan-paparazzi","name":"Jan Paparazzi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1873_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"257"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-05T09:21:00-08:00","id":42928,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Storyteller</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/36190-world-of-darkness-mmo-has-been-cancelled-at-ccp-onyx-path-will-continue-publishing-white-wolf-books?p=42594#post42594\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It is logical that they should do everything within good business-sense to make the game, yes. However, the best laid plans and all that. Sometimes what looked like the perfect idea up front doesn't pan out in the end. There always comes a point when a company struggling with a project has to decide, &quot;Is it a good idea to keep pursuing this? Or should we just cut our losses?&quot;<br /> <br /> That hasn't happened yet with the WOD MMO as far as I know. Some of the folks we know continue to work on the project. All we as fans can do is keep hoping, and make sure CCP knows we still want the game.</div> </div> </div> </div>Why don't they crowd source this one? I am pretty sure they can get enough money with kickstarter. There are all kind of niche games on kickstarter getting proper funding, despite being written off like the space sim genre (Elite, Star Citizen) or the point and click genre (Tim Schafer). I think a WoD mumorpuger will get them the funding to get a proper team together.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1873-jan-paparazzi","name":"Jan Paparazzi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1873_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"257"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-05T11:29:26-08:00","id":43027,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jan Paparazzi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/36190-world-of-darkness-mmo-has-been-cancelled-at-ccp-onyx-path-will-continue-publishing-white-wolf-books?p=42928#post42928\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Why don't they crowd source this one? I am pretty sure they can get enough money with kickstarter. There are all kind of niche games on kickstarter getting proper funding, despite being written off like the space sim genre (Elite, Star Citizen) or the point and click genre (Tim Schafer). I think a WoD mumorpuger will get them the funding to get a proper team together.</div> </div> </div> </div>Because kickstarter doesn't raise enough money for anything but an indy level of effort. Which is fine and all, but it's going to be short and look sub-par compared to new releases.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-07T02:18:27-08:00","id":44039,"title":"","content":"Yeah, these days the game developing is hideously expensive compared to the golder years of gaming industry when a lone crusader would sit at the corner of his bedroom hacking code months on end until wee hours to produce the-best-game-ever-tm.<br /> <br /> Stil a KS-project could work great as a way to gauge interest for the game besides just a way to collect funding.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1700-blue-fox","name":"Blue Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1700_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-08T16:27:34-08:00","id":45211,"title":"","content":"Yeah, you never know. I read somewhere they raised $30 million for Star Citizen. Not bad for a space sim, a genre that is supposed to be dead. Now this is an exception, but there are several game on KS that raised a few million. Tim Schafer's point and click adventure for example, a few oldschool RPG's like Torment and even a few board games made good money there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1873-jan-paparazzi","name":"Jan Paparazzi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1873_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"257"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-08T16:53:28-08:00","id":45220,"title":"","content":"note the numbers I mention. A small crew is taking half a decade to build the game at a minimum burn of 4-5 million a year. <br /> <br /> So a few million while good for an indy game, will get you a small dev team with a limited scope on the end product. Which is good if it's a product that you just want to get out there, because it's been repeatedly rejected as a big name game or doesn't have enough pull to do it right (Shadowrun, Wasteland 2). If it's a major product with some potential, you generally want to invest big in it and aim it for a broader market.<br /> <br /> And MMO games? The problem there is that you're looking at a lot of running costs and a HUGE need for advertising. In fact when it comes to game budgets, that's one of the big lines between the major houses and the indies... the advertising budget.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-09T17:09:58-08:00","id":45926,"title":"","content":"Well, at least we have the trailers. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1873-jan-paparazzi","name":"Jan Paparazzi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1873_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"257"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-10T08:40:54-08:00","id":46285,"title":"","content":"Not enough for me personally.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Onyx Path Kickstarters I back.<br /> W20, MtC, CB20, DtD, MtAs20, BotW20, Wraith 20th.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1442-paladindemo","name":"PaladinDemo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join