.theonyxpath.com/member/1442-paladindemo","name":"PaladinDemo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"622"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-14T09:23:54-08:00","id":72026,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://massively.joystiq.com/2014/02/14/world-of-darkness-drawing-inspiration-from-sandbox-survival-game/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://massively.joystiq.com/2014/02/14/world-of-darkness-drawing-inspiration-from-sandbox-survival-game/\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://massively.joystiq.com/2014/02/14/world-of-darkness-drawing-inspiration-from-sandbox-survival-game/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://massively.joystiq.com/2014/02/14/world-of-darkness-drawing-inspiration-from-sandbox-survival-game/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Just gonna leave this here. Maybe it'll spark a conversation, maybe not. But just saw this today.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><i><span style=\"color:darkred\">Got an angel on the left hand and a devil on the right<br /> She's gonna raise a little hell up in heaven tonight---Vixen</span></i></div> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:olive\"><i>When you say it's all divine and meant to be<br /> What about your flesh and blood and defiers like me?---Avantasia</i></span></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/821-rayvin-miyu","name":"Rayvin Miyu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar821_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-14T09:52:55-08:00","id":72038,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rayvin Miyu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/36190-world-of-darkness-mmo-has-been-cancelled-at-ccp-onyx-path-will-continue-publishing-white-wolf-books?p=72026#post72026\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"http://massively.joystiq.com/2014/02/14/world-of-darkness-drawing-inspiration-from-sandbox-survival-game/\" target=\"_blank\">http://massively.joystiq.com/2014/02...survival-game/</a><br /> <br /> Just gonna leave this here. Maybe it'll spark a conversation, maybe not. But just saw this today.</div> </div> </div> </div>Makes me a bit wary actually. <br /> <br /> When you work on a large project, you need to identify the core elements and the goals of the product early on. <br /> <br /> &quot;We are making a first person game focused on stealth and in-character deal brokering in a world that is not overtly hostile towards them, and where the biggest risks are others of their own kind&quot; for example. You then have people making it so that the graphics are focused on first person maybe with a not-completely-crappy 3rd person view, heavy development on stealth mechanics and story, the combat system taking a decided back seat in the system, and putting a lot of effort into a deal brokering system.<br /> <br /> If you then go &quot;You know what is doing very well right now? Party/group based games. we should cash in on that, and amp up combat. Let's make that darkness dark with blood. Need to get into a box factory? You should have to shoot down at least 5 guards 'cause that's gritty and we need grit to sell this thing&quot;<br /> <br /> Now granted, the changes are not likely to be that significant, but you can see where I'm coming from. Adding/dropping elements or significant changes are pretty much a &quot;welcome back to square one&quot; move. And then of course because you have deadlines you have to cram the full development cycle into a much shorter time. And then you end up with something like the Colonial Marines game.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-14T10:39:29-08:00","id":72067,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Article</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/36190-world-of-darkness-mmo-has-been-cancelled-at-ccp-onyx-path-will-continue-publishing-white-wolf-books?p=72026#post72026\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">&quot;</span></span><a href=\"http://massively.joystiq.com/tag/dayz\" target=\"_blank\"><i>DayZ</i></a><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"> and </span></span><i>Rust </i><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">have shown us the power of a sandbox when you bring it into a more recognizable context. The creators of those experiences often reference </span></span><a href=\"http://massively.joystiq.com/category/eve-online\" target=\"_blank\"><i>EVE Online</i></a><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"> as an inspiration for their things. We're now cross-inspired by what we're seeing there. How the absence of all these structured game mechanics -\u2013 by just allowing these natural interactions to happen -\u2013 that is something we're definitely incorporating into how we think about </span></span><i>World of Darkness</i><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">.&quot;</span></span></div> </div> </div> </div>The only &quot;natural interactions&quot; I have ever seen from DayZ and Rust are griefing other players and being griefed yourself. Was there not enough of that in their EVE-inspired model already?<br /> <br /> There's a reason most MMOs have shunned this kind of thing since Ultima Online's early days. There's a niche who enjoys it, but virtually everyone outside that niche just finds it toxic. Seems like every update leaves me more disappointed in CCP's direction with this project.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/16-cielle","name":"Cielle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar16_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"267"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-14T11:10:16-08:00","id":72089,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cielle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/36190-world-of-darkness-mmo-has-been-cancelled-at-ccp-onyx-path-will-continue-publishing-white-wolf-books?p=72067#post72067\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There's a reason most MMOs have shunned this kind of thing since Ultima Online's early days. There's a niche who enjoys it, but virtually everyone outside that niche just finds it toxic. Seems like every update leaves me more disappointed in CCP's direction with this project.</div> </div> </div> </div>Amusingly the next ultima-online-esk product that is in development is aiming to get around this by allowing you create characters in one of three modes. fully public in which case you get to deal with all humanity, private in which the world is your own, and semi-public in which you have your own world that your friends can create characters in.<br /> <br /> So even they are moving away from the model.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-14T14:51:16-08:00","id":72241,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>IanWatson</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/36190-world-of-darkness-mmo-has-been-cancelled-at-ccp-onyx-path-will-continue-publishing-white-wolf-books?p=36164#post36164\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Given that the MMO is Eddy's day job, I'll believe him when he says it's still in active development.</div> </div> </div> </div>And you are sure he hasn't been moved to the basement along with his stapler?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forever and always forward.<br /> Don't ask why that came to mind or that I felt the need to post it.<br /> I see the incorporeally challenged.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/787-sorwen","name":"Sorwen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-15T08:39:17-08:00","id":72637,"title":"","content":"Yep. No basement dungeon for Mr. Webb, he has Office Space.<br /> <br /> At work at least. Can't speak for his personal life. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Onyx Path Forum Administrator</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">Posts in this color are moderator posts</span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this color mean a Great Old One has driven me mad.</span></span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":11,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11-darksider","user":"Darksider","date":". 02-17-2014, 12:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11-darksider","name":"Darksider","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11_2.jpeg","title":"Forum Administrator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1692"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-15T11:27:18-08:00","id":72732,"title":"","content":"I've been pretty interested once I heard about the WoD MMO being planned but the more I'm hearing of it, I'm not sure it'll be the game for me. There's a reason ( or maybe a few reasons... ) why I don't play Rust or EVE or pretty much most PvP-centric games. ....more griefers than anything else. These games seem to be made just for griefers.<br /> <br /> A long while back I didn't have a problem being competitive with other people...back when I played the Pokemon TCG and Pokemon Stadium competitions. Even then, I liked to make my time with others as pleasant as possible by being friendly and making sure to present myself in as nice a way as possible. A lot of people looked down on me and pushed past me when I offered to shake hands before and after a match, didn't want to make idle chatter while the game was going on, and would get moody when I congratulated those that I went against ( didn't matter if I won or lost...and I lost more than I remember winning ).<br /> <br /> These same behaviors and worse have just gotten...well...worse over the years and on in online play ( and still in TCG circles when I tried to play Magic: The Gathering ).<br /> <br /> Kinda strange and depressing that you grow up learning good sportsmanship but see it rarely ever in use...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><i><span style=\"color:darkred\">Got an angel on the left hand and a devil on the right<br /> She's gonna raise a little hell up in heaven tonight---Vixen</span></i></div> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:olive\"><i>When you say it's all divine and meant to be<br /> What about your flesh and blood and defiers like me?---Avantasia</i></span></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/821-rayvin-miyu","name":"Rayvin Miyu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar821_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-15T11:52:24-08:00","id":72749,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rayvin Miyu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/36190-world-of-darkness-mmo-has-been-cancelled-at-ccp-onyx-path-will-continue-publishing-white-wolf-books?p=72732#post72732\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Kinda strange and depressing that you grow up learning good sportsmanship but see it rarely ever in use...</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't really enjoy playing 