e_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rayvin Miyu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/36190-world-of-darkness-mmo-has-been-cancelled-at-ccp-onyx-path-will-continue-publishing-white-wolf-books?p=72732#post72732\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've been pretty interested once I heard about the WoD MMO being planned but the more I'm hearing of it, I'm not sure it'll be the game for me. There's a reason ( or maybe a few reasons... ) why I don't play Rust or EVE or pretty much most PvP-centric games. ....more griefers than anything else. These games seem to be made just for griefers.</div> </div> </div> </div>I do worry it could become nothing but GvP(Griefer vs Player). That is why as much that Final Death is an important part of the lore/dsystem I hope it isn't in or very restrictive. People that didn't care about it would simply do it to mess with other players. The anonymity of the internet/online tends to make people bigger assholes. There is a sort of checks and balances in the RP of the game that isn't backed by the system of it.<br /> <br /> I've been dying for this MMO since the day I had to stop playing on the MUD/MUSH I use to play on. I'm the bug that know that light is likely to be a bug zapper, but I just have to go toward the light. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forever and always forward.<br /> Don't ask why that came to mind or that I felt the need to post it.<br /> I see the incorporeally challenged.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count