","content":"I wish I could say I was surprised, but CCP has only seemed half interested in actually making this game. I just hope that this doesn't end up affecting the Onyx Path crew if CCP ends up deciding to dump the IP or something.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/nbylxup\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/n18segp\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0v25ewp\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/n77xu8p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1667-novagain","name":"Novagain","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"92"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-14T10:47:24-07:00","id":112757,"title":"","content":"Im not the least bit surprised though at least now its official theres a chance of some movement. Ive said before that if it wasnt for CCP we'd have had other pc games based in the setting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1440-lordofash","name":"LordOfAsh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1440_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"106"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-14T10:49:33-07:00","id":112761,"title":"","content":"We are still here, and we are still writing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/84-holden","name":"Holden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar84_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"673"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-14T11:17:31-07:00","id":112789,"title":"","content":"It is confirmed. CCP sucks. <a href=\"http://www.ccpgames.com/en/public-relations/press-releases/article/77171/ccp-games-halts-development-of-world-of-darkness-mmo/\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.ccpgames.com/en/public-re...-darkness-mmo/</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1117-overload","name":"overload","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1117_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-14T11:21:20-07:00","id":112790,"title":"","content":"Awful news for the folks losing their jobs. I wasn't terribly interested in the WoD MMO, but it was an idea with a lot of potential. I hope everyone lands on their feet.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Masquiem:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Caine in Requiem 2nd</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Storytellers Vault: </b></span><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=None%20More%20Dark%20Publishing#affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\">Author Page</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","name":"Yossarian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-14T11:25:06-07:00","id":112793,"title":"","content":"Our friends got hit in this layoff. We feel like shit for them.<br /> <br /> To be clear, nothing changed in Onyx's licensing relationship with CCP today. As I've said elsewhere, we're concerned for our comrades, not ourselves.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-14T11:26:16-07:00","id":112795,"title":"","content":"Reposting from the other thread on the subject so all bases are covered.<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Storyteller</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">I only ask that while we mull through this topic, of which there is much to discuss in the long and short term, remember that the most important and immediate impact is on the 56 human beings who are waiting to find out if they have a job tomorrow or not. Their well being is of the utmost importance to us here. Please remember them first during this conversation, and show them as much sympathy and compassion as possible. All else is secondary.</div> </div> </div> </div></span></b>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>I game. This is the way.</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8-storyteller","name":"Storyteller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-14T12:00:17-07:00","id":112830,"title":"","content":"Well that sucks.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For these reasons, the trade of a soldier is held the most honourable of all others; because a soldier is a Yahoo hired to kill, in cold blood, as many of his own species, who have never offended him, as possibly he can.&quot; \u2015 from &quot;Gulliver's Travels&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1041-brjedi26","name":"brjedi26","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1041_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"495"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-14T12:18:02-07:00","id":112846,"title":"","content":"Rose and Michael. Why is CCP / WW so adamantly opposed to listening to their fans? I am part of quite a few Web groups and Facebook groups all who were dedicated to this game and all of which at one point or another mentioned the willingness to fire up a kickstarter to raise funds to make this happen! Every time CCP layed off employees for this I'm fairly sure I saw something about kickstarter mentioned. These people didn't need to loose their jobs and this game with all its potential for awesome dies because of stubbornness. Not only did they waste 8 years but now they still have the rights to the genre so nobody else can work on it either. Bloodlines 2?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1117-overload","name":"overload","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1117_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-14T12:21:22-07:00","id":112847,"title":"","content":"I don't think a Kickstarter would have generated the money CCP needed to fulfill their vision, nor do I think the cancellation was a purely financial matter. But I think that's a discussion for later. Now isn't the time to do <i>Behind the Music</i>, while so many people are suddenly out of work.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-14T12:21:22-07:00","id":112848,"title":"","content":"Terrible news but as many have said, not the least bit surprising. I'm positive those affected will land on their feet.<br /> <br /> Now, if only my prayers are answered and CCP gives full control of the White Wolf properties to someone that will do them justice(i.e. Onyx Path).<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-14T12:32:14-07:00","id":112860,"title":"","content":"Sometimes, I wish I wasn't right about things. I wanted so much to be proven wrong. And while, yeah, it's a horrible tragedy for the fired people, it also makes the fans disregarded -- it feels that CCP dropped the ball on this. They were having problems but instead of admitting so, there was this almost righteous indignation from them whenever someone so much as insinuated that the game might not be coming out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2736-bookmark-ana","name":"Bookmark Ana","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2736_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-14T12:36:10-07:00","id":112868,"title":"","content":"A pity the team had to be fired, as opposed to moved to another project (hopefully also within the WoD IP). But, truth be said, MMORPGs aren't a good market right now. It's much more likely that the WoD MMO would have failed - see the great majority of MMORPGs - than that it would have become a nice success.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2518-erasculio","name":"Erasculio","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2518_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-14T12:47:33-07:00","id":112881,"title":"","content":"Well stay strong Rose. Due to lack of feedback from Chris and Eddy who I regularly see info, you are our Luke Skywalker. Keep our World of Darkness Tabletop alive.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1117-overload","name":"overload","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1117_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-14T12:51:43-07:00","id":112885,"title":"","content":"So...what does this mean for Onyx Path Publishing? Is CCP looking to offload the IP? Are they going to sit on it in perpetuity (essentially killing it)? Is the publishing side just going to continue on as it has been, or should fans brace themselves for some worst case scenario? <br /> <br /> I feel for everyone directly impacted (I've been downsized before myself). I hope everyone does their best to roll with the punch, and land on their feet (ready to chew bubblegum and kick ass).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2587-zen_hydra","name":"Zen_Hydra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2587_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-14T12:53:37-07:00","id":112886,"title":"","content":"What exactly does this mean for Onyx Path Publishing? As fans, what can we expect in the way of fallout to the publishing side of things?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2587-zen_hydra","name":"Zen_Hydra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2587_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-14T13:00:00-07:00","id":112888,"title":"","content":"Hm. I'd have thought that after this much time and money, CCP would be committed to the project financially if nothing else in hopes of seeing a return on their investment, but maybe that's why I'm not a business major.<br /> <br /> My best to those who find themselves downsized (there's a heartless euphemism of a term if ever there was one).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-14T13:07:01-07:00","id":112894,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Erasculio</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/36190-world-of-darkness-mmo-has-been-cancelled-at-ccp-onyx-path-will-continue-publishing-white-wolf-books?p=112868#post112868\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A pity the team had to be fired, as opposed to moved to another project (hopefully also within the WoD IP).</div> </div> </div> </div>According to the news coverage, some of them will be moved over to EVE Online. <br /> <br /> It's a shitty situation all around. I just hope the staff saw it coming early enough to make the appropriate plans.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-14T13:10:35-07:00","id":112897,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zen_Hydra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/36190-world-of-darkness-mmo-has-been-cancelled-at-ccp-onyx-path-will-continue-publishing-white-wolf-books?p=112886#post112886\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What exactly does this mean for Onyx Path Publishing? As fans, what can we expect in the way of fallout to the publishing side of things?</div> </div> </div> </div>Currently, this doesn't change anything for Onyx Path. CCP hasn't said anything to us about changing the publishing arrangement.<br /> <br /> Rich will talk a little about it in his weekly blog.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-14T13:12:18-07:00","id":112898,"title":"","content":"I actually posted this on the other forum but didnt know I should actually be posting it here....so here....<br /> <br /> Hey all,<br /> <br /> Here is a petition link to CCP games requesting reinstatement of the development of World of Darkness Online MMORPG. Check it out.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.change.org/en-AU/petitions/ccp-games-corporate-reinstate-development-of-world-of-darkness-online-mmorpg-and-devote-the-same-level-of-resources-funding-and-priority-to-it-as-you-do-eve-online#\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://assets.change.org/photos/1/yw/bu/odywBUlRVtdeDLR-1600x900-noPad.jpg?1521300731\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.change.org/en-AU/petitions/ccp-games-corporate-reinstate-development-of-world-of-darkness-online-mmorpg-and-devote-the-same-level-of-resources-funding-and-priority-to-it-as-you-do-eve-online#\" target=\"_blank\"> Sign the Petition </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.change.org/en-AU/petitions/ccp-games-corporate-reinstate-development-of-world-of-darkness-online-mmorpg-and-devote-the-same-level-of-resources-funding-and-priority-to-it-as-you-do-eve-online#\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.change.org/en-AU/petitions/ccp-games-corporate-reinstate-development-of-world-of-darkness-online-mmorpg-and-devote-the-same-level-of-resources-funding-and-priority-to-it-as-you-do-eve-online# </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Reinstate development of World of Darkness Online MMORPG and devote the same level of resources, funding and priority to it as you do EVE Online. </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Cheers","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/7019410/Images/Ex3%20KS%20Badge.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img31/2512/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/488-blackwood","name":"Blackwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar488_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-14T13:12:21-07:00","id":112899,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zen_Hydra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/36190-world-of-darkness-mmo-has-been-cancelled-at-ccp-onyx-path-will-continue-publishing-white-wolf-books?p=112885#post112885\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So...what does this mean for Onyx Path Publishing? Is CCP looking to offload the IP? Are they going to sit on it in perpetuity (essentially killing it)? Is the publishing side just going to continue on as it has been, or should fans brace themselves for some worst case scenario?<br /> <br /> I feel for everyone directly impacted (I've been downsized before myself). I hope everyone does their best to roll with the punch, and land on their feet (ready to chew bubblegum and kick ass).</div> </div> </div> </div>The longer term outlook is unknown. However, CCP has a license to develop the RPG properties for WoD and Exalted. It's profitable, if not hugely so. Rationally it wouldn't make sense to simply shut down an income source for no purpose, and if they were to opt to sell the property on, I doubt any new owners would object to profit... few companies do.<br /> <br /> So at the moment, it's a bit up in the air, as with all such cases, follow the money and the money says it's probably going to continue as long as there is demand, even while changes might happen in the ownership. This is not an absolute of course, but it's pretty much the rational assumption to make.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-14T13:13:01-07:00","id":112900,"title":"","content":"Hey all,<br /> <br /> Here is a petition link to CCP games requesting reinstatement of the development of World of Darkness Online MMORPG. Check it out.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.change.org/en-AU/petitions/ccp-games-corporate-reinstate-development-of-world-of-darkness-online-mmorpg-and-devote-the-same-level-of-resources-funding-and-priority-to-it-as-you-do-eve-online#\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://assets.change.org/photos/1/yw/bu/odywBUlRVtdeDLR-1600x900-noPad.jpg?1521300731\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.change.org/en-AU/petitions/ccp-games-corporate-reinstate-development-of-world-of-darkness-online-mmorpg-and-devote-the-same-level-of-resources-funding-and-priority-to-it-as-you-do-eve-online#\" target=\"_blank\"> Sign the Petition </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.change.org/en-AU/petitions/ccp-games-corporate-reinstate-development-of-world-of-darkness-online-mmorpg-and-devote-the-same-level-of-resources-funding-and-priority-to-it-as-you-do-eve-online#\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.change.org/en-AU/petitions/ccp-games-corporate-reinstate-development-of-world-of-darkness-online-mmorpg-and-devote-the-same-level-of-resources-funding-and-priority-to-it-as-you-do-eve-online# </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Reinstate development of World of Darkness Online MMORPG and devote the same level of resources, funding and priority to it as you do EVE Online. </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Cheers","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/7019410/Images/Ex3%20KS%20Badge.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img31/2512/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/488-blackwood","name":"Blackwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar488_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-14T13:13:24-07:00","id":112901,"title":"","content":"I'd suggest focusing conversation on this to the other thread so we don't multiple streams or worse, cross the streams.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-14T13:27:18-07:00","id":112907,"title":"","content":"Disappointed, but not surprised. This was one of two MMOs I have any interest in. Wishing good luck in finding new work to those laid off, I believe Chris Roberts is still hiring.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/757-filli-noctus","name":"filli noctus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"124"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-14T13:35:11-07:00","id":112910,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rose Bailey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/36190-world-of-darkness-mmo-has-been-cancelled-at-ccp-onyx-path-will-continue-publishing-white-wolf-books?p=112897#post112897\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Currently, this doesn't change anything for Onyx Path. CCP hasn't said anything to us about changing the publishing arrangement.<br /> <br /> Rich will talk a little about it in his weekly blog.</div> </div> </div> </div>That\u2019s good, Rose. I just read that Eddy was one of those laid off, and I hope that this doesn\u2019t affect the approvals process without his guidance. Of course, I also hope he gets something new and awesome soon!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u200b<span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\">Dante \u201cOwns-All-the-Books\u201d Laughing-Coyote<br /> <a href=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/91390940/Werewolf%20the%20Apocalypse%20Reference.xlsx\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf (and Human) Reference Excel Spreadsheet</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/clouddrive/share?s=VoD6R2UDSGwijaft3H4kbM\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img593/9752/w20supporterhiddengarou.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img692/7017/hh2support.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img546/6111/wpur.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img31/2512/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1765-rderekp","name":"rderekp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1765_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-14T13:52:05-07:00","id":112918,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zen_Hydra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/36190-world-of-darkness-mmo-has-been-cancelled-at-ccp-onyx-path-will-continue-publishing-white-wolf-books?p=112885#post112885\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So...what does this mean for Onyx Path Publishing? Is CCP looking to offload the IP? Are they going to sit on it in perpetuity (essentially killing it)? Is the publishing side just going to continue on as it has been, or should fans brace themselves for some worst case scenario?</div> </div> </div> </div>As I said in the other thread, this has no immediate impact on us. Rich will talk about it in his weekly blog.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-14T14:20:59-07:00","id":112928,"title":"","content":"Sucks for the people that were laid off, but I felt this wasn't gone to happen when it was first announced eight years ago.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1303-zap-rowsdower","name":"zap rowsdower","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1303_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"63"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-14T15:21:19-07:00","id":112965,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/wod-mmo-news-and-views/\" target=\"_blank\">Rich has posted about it.</a> CCP's happy with the publishing license as it stands, and Eddy, though no longer a full-time employee, will be continuing to handle our approvals as a consultant. So now's not the time to worry about the World of Darkness, so much as to have sympathy and solidarity with friends in a shitty situation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-14T17:11:57-07:00","id":113025,"title":"","content":"Ugh.... Many hugs all around for those that got laid off and to have to give up on the game. ...at least for now for all we know. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><i><span style=\"color:darkred\">Got an angel on the left hand and a devil on the right<br /> She's gonna raise a little hell up in heaven tonight---Vixen</span></i></div> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:olive\"><i>When you say it's all divine and meant to be<br /> What about your flesh and blood and defiers like me?---Avantasia</i></span></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/821-rayvin-miyu","name":"Rayvin Miyu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar821_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-14T19:32:42-07:00","id":113069,"title":"","content":"Man, I am really bummed out to hear this. I sincerely hope that everyone involved with the project lands on their feet.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Sure, there's no way to canonically do it, but Exalted allows you to knee canon in the crotch and rifle through its pockets to take what you need while it whimpers on the ground. - mockery","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/374-nocte-ex-mortis","name":"Nocte ex Mortis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar374_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"486"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-14T20:01:42-07:00","id":113088,"title":"","content":"When my brother was part of the layoffs a couple years back, I had a feeling it would one day come to this. It's unfortunate that such a dedicated and good group of people lost their jobs. Here's hoping they all land on their feet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/457-arcanus-dicere","name":"Arcanus Dicere","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar457_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"353"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-14T21:13:22-07:00","id":113120,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Holden</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/36190-world-of-darkness-mmo-has-been-cancelled-at-ccp-onyx-path-will-continue-publishing-white-wolf-books?p=112761#post112761\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">We are still here, and we are still writing.</div> </div> </div> </div>For now. Sooner or later, CCP will decide that unloading the WOD and Exalted IPs will benefit EVE somehow. And it makes me a little nauseous to think of them in the hands of someone like EA or Activision.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/nbylxup\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/n18segp\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0v25ewp\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/n77xu8p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1667-novagain","name":"Novagain","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"92"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-14T21:17:42-07:00","id":113123,"title":"","content":"This is truly sad to hear. I continue to hope that CCP sells the IP and that OPP buys it. <br /> Wishing the very best to everyone most impacted by this terrible news.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Assistant Organizer for:</b><br /> <a href=\"http://www.meetup.com/Dead-Gamers-Society/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i162.photobucket.com/albums/t261/jlburgos_bucket/a41e98d1-1eed-4506-a8d2-2b3bea4a43da_zps469395ad.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/311-joeb","name":"JoeB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar311_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-14T21:49:41-07:00","id":113128,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Novagain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/36190-world-of-darkness-mmo-has-been-cancelled-at-ccp-onyx-path-will-continue-publishing-white-wolf-books?p=113120#post113120\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And it makes me a little nauseous to think of them in the hands of someone like EA or Activision.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bThere are people who I think could make an excellent video game with the IP. I'd absolutely love to see Bethesda pick up the rights and give one of the settings their trademark open-world treatment. And Obsidian's games are frequently flawed, yet they always end up my favorites because every story Chris Avellone touches blows me away.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/16-cielle","name":"Cielle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar16_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"267"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-14T22:33:36-07:00","id":113136,"title":"","content":"There was a reply in the CCP forums stating they knew the value of the IP and didn't currently have plans to sell it off, of course this is subject to change at their discretion.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Onyx Path Forum Administrator</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">Posts in this color are moderator posts</span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this color mean a Great Old One has driven me mad.</span></span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11-darksider","name":"Darksider","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11_2.jpeg","title":"Forum Administrator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1692"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-14T23:23:52-07:00","id":113155,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cielle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/36190-world-of-darkness-mmo-has-been-cancelled-at-ccp-onyx-path-will-continue-publishing-white-wolf-books?p=113128#post113128\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> \u200bThere are people who I think could make an excellent video game with the IP. I'd absolutely love to see Bethesda pick up the rights and give one of the settings their trademark open-world treatment. And Obsidian's games are frequently flawed, yet they always end up my favorites because every story Chris Avellone touches blows me away.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd be a bit wary of Bethesda given what they did to the fallout tabletop RPG, but as a company they have potential.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-14T23:54:44-07:00","id":113163,"title":"","content":"Would it be possible to find out anything about what the MMO would have been like, or is that too buried?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1136-wolfgar","name":"Wolfgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"646"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-15T00:24:02-07:00","id":113174,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/36190-world-of-darkness-mmo-has-been-cancelled-at-ccp-onyx-path-will-continue-publishing-white-wolf-books?p=112888#post112888\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hm. I'd have thought that after this much time and money, CCP would be committed to the project financially if nothing else in hopes of seeing a return on their investment, but maybe that's why I'm not a business major.</div> </div> </div> </div>If the expected cost of building something starts to exceed the projected overall rate of return on investment, you start considering pulling the plug. CCP's main cash cow is the Eve universe (Eve, Dust, and Valkyrie) and have made the choice to keep expanding on that rather than spending the cash on a new IP.<br /> <br /> edit: also, CCP fucked up with it's PR on the Eve subreddit when the announcement hit it there. Best to avoid that if you wish to contain your rage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/604-shock","name":"Shock","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar604_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1071"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-15T04:03:44-07:00","id":113231,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wolfgar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/36190-world-of-darkness-mmo-has-been-cancelled-at-ccp-onyx-path-will-continue-publishing-white-wolf-books?p=113163#post113163\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Would it be possible to find out anything about what the MMO would have been like, or is that too buried?</div> </div> </div> </div>According to some guy on the internet ( and we know how trustworthy they are) these are &quot;leaked&quot; screenshots. I expect more to come soon.<br /> <img src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=336&amp;type=large\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/> <img src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=337&amp;type=large\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1303,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1303-zap-rowsdower","user":"zap rowsdower","date":". 04-15-2014, 07:06 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1303-zap-rowsdower","name":"zap rowsdower","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1303_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"63"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-15T04:34:09-07:00","id":113240,"title":"","content":"Now I've had time to think about it I can completely see why CCP cancelled it. The MMO market is both saturated and shrinking. WoW's bleeding subscribers and most other high profile games are either shutting down or going F2P (which seems to be the final step before shutting down). The dismal launch of Elder Scrolls Online was probably the impetus to can the project, after all a WoD MMO would be a niche game in a difficult market when CCP need to shore up their main (only) product to prevent it going the way of everything else in the MMO space.<br /> <br /> Hopefully the project can be resurrected once the MMO sector has stabilised at a lower level and in the meantime the assets already produced could be licensed to a thord party developer to create a single player Vampire game that CCP can publish to get some return on their outlay.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/757-filli-noctus","name":"filli noctus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","cus